ured Dominican. نكهات:  golden بندق, أرز, golden فانيليا. The XO Intermezzo is the most played — like a jazz tune you hum without realizing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Intermezzo\", \"Maestoso\", \"Notturno\", \"Preludio\"]}, {\"name\": \"Uvezian\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Posthumous tribute to the founder — launched after his 2017 death. Connecticut Broadleaf wrapper over Dominican-Nicaraguan. Medium-Full, bolder than the classic ranges. نكهات:  محمَّص bread, قهوة, light spice. The final signature of a man who transformed two passions into one.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He reportedly smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He supuestamente fumaba the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He angeblich rauchte the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He 据报道 smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Avo Uvezian\", \"anecdote\": \"Jazz pianist, composer of \'Strangers in the Night\' (authorship disputed with Bert Kaempfert), friend of Sinatra and Davidoff. He created his first cigars past 60 — proof that the best ideas come late. He continued smoking his own cigars until weeks before his death at 89.\"}, {\"name\": \"Frank Sinatra\", \"anecdote\": \"Sinatra, a great cigar smoker, was a client and friend of Avo Uvezian long before the brand\'s creation. He يُقال إن smoked the first Avo prototypes during a New York recording session.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"Jazz\", \"name\": \"Miles Davis — Kind of Blue\", \"notes\": \"The most obvious pairing — Avo is Miles Davis\' cigar. The modal delicacy of Kind of Blue embraces the creamy sweetness of a Classic No.2.\"}, {\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Hennessy VS\", \"notes\": \"The entry-level cognac — accessible like Avo Classic, complex like a jazz improvisation. A musical evening pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Barahona Dominican coffee\", \"notes\": \"The island coffee, soft and lightly fruity, accompanies the Classic range by respecting its lightness.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Avo';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Bolívar is the cigar that does not negotiate. Founded in 1902 and named in deliberate tribute to Simón Bolívar — the Venezuelan-born general who liberated six South American nations from Spanish colonial rule — the brand has always understood itself as something distinct from the refinements of Havana\'s more diplomatic houses. The portrait on the band shows Bolívar in full military uniform, jaw set, eyes direct. This is not ornamentation. It is a declaration of intent.\r\n\r\nThe brand was created by José F. Rocha and quickly distinguished itself through the sheer force of its tobacco selection. Where other Havana houses of the era sought balance and elegance, Rocha built Bolívar around the darkest, most mature leaves from the Vuelta Abajo growing region — tobaccos that had spent more time fermenting, more time aging, and more time developing the deep earthiness that defines the style. The result was a cigar that divided opinion immediately and has continued to do so for 120 years. It is the most powerful of the major Cuban brands. It asks something of the smoker.\r\n\r\nThe aromatic profile is unlike any other great Cuban. Humid forest floor after rain. Old leather and dark tanning. Unsweetened espresso. Bitter cocoa from Cacao Barry\'s darkest shelf. Occasionally, late in the smoke, a wave of black truffle that experienced enthusiasts recognize as the signature of old Vuelta Abajo fermenting at its peak. These are not metaphors constructed for marketing purposes. They are the consistent testimony of the most experienced tasters in the world, reviewing Bolívar across decades and formats.\r\n\r\nThe Royal Corona — 42 x 127mm, a Petit Robusto — is the house\'s most versatile proposition: 30 minutes of concentrated power that delivers the full Bolívar experience in a format accessible to smokers who cannot commit to a 90-minute session. The Belicosos Finos, in pyramidal Torpedo format at 52 x 140mm, is the brand\'s intellectual center of gravity. The tapering head moderates the intensity of the first third, building progressively through one of the most structured smoking experiences in Cuban tobacco. Its construction demands skill from the torcedor — and rewards patience from the smoker.\r\n\r\nBolívar has always attracted a specific type of enthusiast. Not collectors drawn to rarity or investors tracking limited editions — but smokers who have tasted the full range of Cuban tobacco and chosen the most demanding option with full knowledge of what they were doing. The brand\'s devotees speak of it with a loyalty that approaches the evangelical. The rest of the market tends to describe it, somewhat resentfully, as an acquired taste — which is exactly what its creators intended.', `history_es` = 'Bolívar, fundada en 1902, es el cigarro de los rebeldes y filósofos. Nombrada en homenaje al Libertador Simón Bolívar, es la marca más robusta entre los grandes cubanos. Sus perfiles aromáticos evocan el bosque húmedo, la tierra tras la lluvia, el cuero viejo. El Royal Corona y los Belicosos Finos son sus dos tesoros.', `history_de` = 'Bolívar, 1902 gegründet, ist die Zigarre der Rebellen und Philosophen. Benannt nach dem Libertador Simón Bolívar, ist sie die kräftigste unter den großen kubanischen Marken. Die aromatischen Profile erinnern an feuchten Wald, Erde nach dem Regen, altes Leder.', `history_zh` = '创立于1902年的玻利瓦尔是叛逆者与哲学家的雪茄。以解放者西蒙·玻利瓦尔命名，是古巴主要品牌中最强劲的。其芳香轮廓令人联想到潮湿的森林、雨后的泥土和旧皮革。皇家科罗纳和贝利科索斯菲诺斯是其两大瑰宝。', `history_ar` = 'بوليفار، المؤسَّسة عام 1902، سيجار المتمردين والفلاسفة. سُمِّيت تكريمًا للمحرِّر سيمون بوليفار، وهي الأكثر قوةً بين الماركات الكوبية الكبرى. ملامحها العطرية تستحضر الغابة الرطبة والتربة بعد المطر والجلد القديم.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Notes of damp soil, roasted coffee, long pepper. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Notes of dark wood, undergrowth, black spices.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 minutes that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European collectors. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. La most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Notas de damp soil, tostado café, long pimienta. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Notas de dark wood, undergrowth, black especias.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 minutos that travel through all la aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European coleccionistas. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. Noten von damp soil, geröstet Kaffee, long Pfeffer. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. Noten von dark wood, undergrowth, black Gewürze.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 Minuten that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European collectors. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. 风味： damp soil, 烘焙 咖啡, long 胡椒. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. 风味： dark wood, undergrowth, black 香料.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90分钟 that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European 收藏家. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Belicosos Finos\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Belicosos format (52 x 140mm), pyramidal. The house\'s most powerful format. The conical shape concentrates Bolívar\'s earthy aromas into an almost medicinal intensity. نكهات:  damp soil, محمَّص قهوة, long فلفل. Only to be smoked after a hearty meal. Aging in the humidor is essential: three years minimum.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Belicosos Finos\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 94, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Royal Corona\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Petit Corona (42 x 127mm). More accessible than the Belicosos but without compromise on character. The Royal Corona is the everyday Bolívar — for those whose \'everyday\' means full body without exception. نكهات:  dark wood, undergrowth, black توابل.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Royal Corona\"]}, {\"name\": \"Coronas Gigantes\", \"color\": \"#4A235A\", \"story\": \"Double Corona (42 x 178mm). The longest Bolívar format — 90 دقيقة that travel through all the house\'s aromatic registers. Rare, barely distributed, sought by European الجامعون. The third hour of a Corona Gigantes is a journey in itself.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Coronas Gigantes\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Che Guevara\", \"anecdote\": \"Guevara, who generally preferred bold Cuban cigars, was known to alternate between Cohiba and Bolívar depending on his mood. \'Bolívar is for when you have something to solve,\' he reportedly said.\"}, {\"name\": \"Jean-Paul Sartre\", \"anecdote\": \"The French existentialist, who became a cigar smoker after years with a pipe, discovered Bolívar during his visits to Cuba in the 1960s and described them as \'the only absolutely honest thing in this world.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Che Guevara\", \"anecdote\": \"Guevara, who generally preferred bold Cuban cigars, was known to alternate between Cohiba and Bolívar depending on his mood. \'Bolívar is for when you have something to solve,\' he supuestamente said.\"}, {\"name\": \"Jean-Paul Sartre\", \"anecdote\": \"The French existentialist, who became a cigar smoker after years with a pipe, discovered Bolívar during his visits to Cuba in the 1960s and described them as \'the only absolutely honest thing in this world.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Che Guevara\", \"anecdote\": \"Guevara, who generally preferred bold Cuban cigars, was known to alternate between Cohiba and Bolívar depending on his mood. \'Bolívar is for when you have something to solve,\' he angeblich said.\"}, {\"name\": \"Jean-Paul Sartre\", \"anecdote\": \"The French existentialist, who became a cigar smoker after years with a pipe, discovered Bolívar during his visits to Cuba in the 1960s and described them as \'the only absolutely honest thing in this world.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Che Guevara\", \"anecdote\": \"Guevara, who generally preferred bold Cuban cigars, was known to alternate between Cohiba and Bolívar depending on his mood. \'Bolívar is for when you have something to solve,\' he 据报道 said.\"}, {\"name\": \"Jean-Paul Sartre\", \"anecdote\": \"The French existentialist, who became a cigar smoker after years with a pipe, discovered Bolívar during his visits to Cuba in the 1960s and described them as \'the only absolutely honest thing in this world.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Che Guevara\", \"anecdote\": \"Guevara, who generally preferred bold Cuban cigars, was known to alternate between Cohiba and Bolívar depending on his mood. \'Bolívar is for when you have something to solve,\' he يُقال إن said.\"}, {\"name\": \"Jean-Paul Sartre\", \"anecdote\": \"The French existentialist, who became a cigar smoker after years with a pipe, discovered Bolívar during his visits to Cuba in the 1960s and described them as \'the only absolutely honest thing in this world.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Artisanal Oaxacan Mezcal\", \"notes\": \"The smoke and earth of mezcal resonate with the telluric profile of Bolívar. A bold pairing for seasoned smokers.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Ethiopian natural process coffee\", \"notes\": \"The fruity and fermented notes of a natural process coffee temper the raw power of Bolívar. An unexpected and remarkable pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"Imperial Stout 12%\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of an imperial stout is one of the few beverages that can stand up to a Belicosos Finos. A winter pairing par excellence.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Licores\", \"name\": \"Artisanal Oaxacan Mezcal\", \"notes\": \"The smoke and earth of mezcal resonate with the telluric profile of Bolívar. A bold pairing for seasoned smokers.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Ethiopian natural process coffee\", \"notes\": \"The fruity and fermented notas de a natural process coffee temper the raw power of Bolívar. An unexpected and remarkable pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"Imperial Stout 12%\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of an imperial stout is one of the few beverages that can stand up to a Belicosos Finos. A winter pairing par excellence.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Spirituosen\", \"name\": \"Artisanal Oaxacan Mezcal\", \"notes\": \"The smoke and earth of mezcal resonate with the telluric profile of Bolívar. A bold pairing for seasoned smokers.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Ethiopian natural process coffee\", \"notes\": \"The fruity and fermented Noten von a natural process coffee temper the raw power of Bolívar. An unexpected and remarkable pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"Imperial Stout 12%\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of an imperial stout is one of the few beverages that can stand up to a Belicosos Finos. A winter pairing par excellence.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"烈酒\", \"name\": \"Artisanal Oaxacan Mezcal\", \"notes\": \"The smoke and earth of mezcal resonate with the telluric profile of Bolívar. A bold pairing for seasoned smokers.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Ethiopian natural process coffee\", \"notes\": \"The fruity and fermented 风味： a natural process coffee temper the raw power of Bolívar. An unexpected and remarkable pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"Imperial Stout 12%\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of an imperial stout is one of the few beverages that can stand up to a Belicosos Finos. A winter pairing par excellence.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"المسكرات\", \"name\": \"Artisanal Oaxacan Mezcal\", \"notes\": \"The smoke and earth of mezcal resonate with the telluric profile of Bolívar. A bold pairing for seasoned smokers.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Ethiopian natural process coffee\", \"notes\": \"The fruity and fermented نكهات: a natural process coffee temper the raw power of Bolívar. An unexpected and remarkable pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"Imperial Stout 12%\", \"notes\": \"The intensity of an imperial stout is one of the few beverages that can stand up to a Belicosos Finos. A winter pairing par excellence.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Bolivar';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The specific commercial insight that created Café Crème was simple and proved durable: millions of Europeans who would never smoke a cigar would happily smoke something that looked and smelled like coffee. Henri Wintermans, who had built his Eersel factory into a reliable supplier of conventional small cigars for the Dutch market by the 1950s, recognized in the growing café culture of postwar Western Europe a potential audience that the traditional cigar trade was not serving and could not have imagined serving.\r\n\r\nThe product that resulted in 1958 was technically a cigarillo — a small, machine-made roll using Indonesian Sumatra wrapper over a blend of Java and Sumatra filler tobaccos, with a mild coffee-extract casing applied during the manufacturing process. The casing contributed an immediate aromatic identifier that the wrapper\'s mild sweetness amplified. The overall character was nothing like a serious premium cigar: no earth, no pepper, no leather, no intensity of any kind. It was gentle, consistent, slightly sweet, and unmistakably pleasant in the context of a coffee served at a French zinc bar counter or an Italian espresso machine.\r\n\r\nThe distribution strategy matched the concept precisely. Wintermans did not target tobacconists or cigar shops — he targeted cafes, brasseries, restaurants, and hotel bars. The small yellow metal box was designed to sit next to the cash register in the same visual register as a box of matches or a packet of breath mints: impulse purchase territory, not considered acquisition. The price point reinforced this positioning: Café Crème cost less than a glass of wine, making the after-dinner ritual accessible to customers who would never spend money in a tobacconist.\r\n\r\nBritish American Tobacco acquired the Wintermans business in the early 1970s, bringing corporate distribution infrastructure to a product that had already achieved remarkable penetration through the founder\'s regional networks. BAT\'s global reach extended Café Crème into markets across Africa, Asia, and the Middle East where the café culture context translated effectively.', `history_es` = 'Henri Wintermans fundó en 1904 en los Países Bajos su fábrica de cigarros y cigarillos. El Café Crème, creado en 1958, es su creación más famosa — un mini cigarro aromatizado al café con tabaco indonesio de Java y Sumatra. En los años 70 y 80 estaba presente en cada bar, cafetería y restaurante de Europa occidental.', `history_de` = 'Henri Wintermans gründete 1904 in den Niederlanden seine Zigaren- und Zigarillofabrik. Das Café Crème, 1958 kreiert, ist seine bekannteste Schöpfung — ein mini Zigarillo mit Kaffeearoma und indonesischem Tabak aus Java und Sumatra. In den 70er und 80er Jahren war es in jedem Bar, Café und Restaurant Westeuropas präsent.', `history_zh` = '亨利·温特曼斯于1904年在荷兰创立了雪茄和小雪茄工厂。1958年创造的咖啡奶油是其最著名的作品——一款带咖啡香气、使用爪哇和苏门答腊印尼烟草的迷你小雪茄。在70和80年代，它出现在西欧每一家酒吧、咖啡馆和餐厅里。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس هنري وينترمانس عام 1904 في هولندا مصنعه للسيجار والسيجاريلو. الكافيه كريم، المبتكَر عام 1958، أشهر إبداعاته — سيجاريلو صغير بعطر القهوة وتبغ إندونيسي من جاوة وسومطرة. في السبعينيات والثمانينيات كان حاضرًا في كل بار ومقهى ومطعم في أوروبا الغربية.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Café Crème Original\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The original product — coffee aroma over Java-Sumatra tobacco. Mini format (34 x 100mm), 10 minutes. Notes of flavored coffee, soft tobacco, light sweetness. The cigar your grandfather smoked after Sunday lunch. Timeless, accessible, universal.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Original\", \"Tubes\"]}, {\"name\": \"Café Crème Blue\", \"color\": \"#003399\", \"story\": \"Menthol version — mint aroma over Java tobacco. For smokers seeking freshness. Less traditional than the Original but regularly in the top 3 of European flavored cigarillo sales.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Blue\", \"Tubes Blue\"]}, {\"name\": \"Café Crème Arome\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"Various flavored versions — vanilla, hazelnut, amaretto. The festive range for enthusiasts who like changing profiles with their mood. Same format and duration as the Original.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Vanille\", \"Noisette\", \"Amaretto\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Café Crème Original\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The original product — café aroma over Java-Sumatra tobacco. Mini format (34 x 100mm), 10 minutes. Notas de flavored café, soft tobacco, light sweetness. The cigar your grandfather smoked after Sunday lunch. Timeless, accessible, universal.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Original\", \"Tubes\"]}, {\"name\": \"Café Crème Blue\", \"color\": \"#003399\", \"story\": \"Menthol version — mint aroma over Java tobacco. For smokers seeking freshness. Less traditional than the Original but regularly in the top 3 of European flavored cigarillo sales.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Blue\", \"Tubes Blue\"]}, {\"name\": \"Café Crème Arome\", \"color\": \"#C04000\", \"story\": \"Various flavored versions — vainilla, avellana, amaretto. The festive range for aficionados who like changing profiles with their mood. Same format and duration as the Original.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Vanille\", \"Noisette\", \"Amaretto\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Café Crème Original\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"The original product — Kaffee aroma over Java-Sumatra tobacco. Mini format (34 x 100mm), 10 minutes. Noten von flavored Kaffee, soft tobacco, light sweetness. The cigar your grandfather smoked after Sunday lunch. Timeless, accessible, universal.\", \"force\": \"Light\", \"wrapper\": \"Indonesian Java\", \"vitolas\": [\"Original\", \"Tubes\"]}, {\"name\": \"Café Crème Blue\", \"color\":