between complexity and accessibility. نكهات:  محمَّص بندق, soft جلد, light فانيليا. The Magnum 46 is often the first H. Upmann one tries — and it convinces immediately.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Magnum 46\"]}, {\"name\": \"Connoisseur No.1\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Lonsdale (42 x 168mm). Long and elegant format, the house\'s signature. The length allows slow aromatic evolution — the first puffs are soft and creamy, the finish يكشف عن unexpected توابل. Appreciated by smokers who take their time.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Connoisseur No.1\", \"Connoisseur No.2\"]}, {\"name\": \"Half Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Mini format (44 x 94mm), 15 دقيقة. H. Upmann has always known how to adapt its character to small format without betraying it. The Half Corona is the قهوة break cigar — intense, direct, honest. Ideal for discovering the house without committing an hour.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Half Corona\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"JFK Kennedy\", \"anecdote\": \"Kennedy sent his press secretary Pierre Salinger to buy 1,200 H. Upmann Petit Upmann the night before signing the Cuban embargo in 1962. He signed the next day, his personal supply secured. This anecdote is one of the most famous in Cuban cigar history.\"}, {\"name\": \"Hermann Upmann\", \"anecdote\": \"The founder invented modern luxury cigar packaging — aluminum tubes, cedar boxes, wax seal. Before him, cigars traveled loose. After him, offering a cigar became an act of civilization.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit notes of Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit notas de Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit Noten von Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit 风味： Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"White Burgundy Grand Cru\", \"notes\": \"The minerality and length of a Meursault or Puligny accompany the creamy finesse of a Sir Winston perfectly. A pairing of great houses.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Glenmorangie 18 years\", \"notes\": \"The vanilla and dried fruit نكهات: Glenmorangie resonate with the sweetness of a Magnum 46. An easy, rewarding pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Jamaican Blue Mountain\", \"notes\": \"The world\'s gentlest and most refined coffee for Cuba\'s most elegant cigar. A connoisseur\'s pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'H. Upmann';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Henri Wintermans arrived in the cigar trade in 1904 with a manufacturer\'s instinct and a commercial ambition that fit the Dutch trading tradition precisely. Based in Eersel in the southern Netherlands — a region where cigar manufacturing had existed since the early nineteenth century, supplied by Dutch colonial networks that controlled significant portions of Sumatran and Javanese tobacco production — Wintermans built a factory that from its first years differentiated itself through the quality of its Indonesian leaf sourcing.\r\n\r\nThe Dutch connection to Indonesian tobacco was the structural advantage that defined the Wintermans business model for its first half-century. The Netherlands had governed the Dutch East Indies since the seventeenth century, and by the twentieth century the trading houses of Amsterdam had developed sophisticated mechanisms for selecting and aging Javanese and Sumatran tobacco that no other European market could match. Wintermans used this network to source wrapper and binder leaf of consistent quality for his small-format cigars and cigarillos — products aimed at the everyday European smoker rather than the luxury collector.\r\n\r\nThe Café Crème, introduced in 1958, became the house\'s defining product and one of the most recognized cigar formats in European history. A small, machine-made cigarillo with a mild coffee-tinged aroma derived partly from the Indonesian wrapper and partly from a light casing applied during production, it occupied a space in the market that no other product filled: accessible, consistent, affordable, and unmistakably a cigar experience rather than a cigarette compromise. By the 1970s, it was present in every café, bar, and restaurant across Western Europe. Its yellow packaging became a visual shorthand for after-dinner relaxation.\r\n\r\nBritish American Tobacco acquired the Wintermans business in the early 1970s as part of its systematic consolidation of the European cigar market. The Café Crème continued under the new ownership without significant reformulation — BAT understood that the product\'s appeal was built on consistency and that changing it would damage precisely what made it commercially valuable. Henri Wintermans cigars and cigarillos continue in production today, still using Indonesian-origin leaf, still sold under the name of a man who understood before most that accessible quality was its own kind of ambition.', `history_es` = 'Henri Wintermans fundó en 1904 en los Países Bajos su fábrica de cigarros. La casa se convirtió en una de las más importantes de Europa comercializando cigarros accesibles con tabacos de Java y Sumatra. El Café Crème (1958) es su creación más icónica. Hoy propiedad de British American Tobacco.', `history_de` = 'Henri Wintermans gründete 1904 in den Niederlanden seine Zigarrenfabrik. Das Haus wurde zu einem der wichtigsten Europas durch den Vertrieb zugänglicher Zigarren mit Java- und Sumatra-Tabaken. Das Café Crème (1958) ist seine ikonischste Kreation. Heute im Besitz von British American Tobacco.', `history_zh` = '亨利·温特曼斯于1904年在荷兰创立了雪茄工厂。该品牌通过销售使用爪哇和苏门答腊烟草的平价雪茄，成为欧洲最重要的品牌之一。咖啡奶油（1958年）是其最具标志性的创作。现为英美烟草公司所有。', `history_ar` = 'أسّس هنري وينترمانس عام 1904 في هولندا مصنع سيجاره. أصبحت الدار من أهم الأوروبية عبر تسويق سيجار ميسور الثمن بتبغ جاوة وسومطرة. الكافيه كريم (1958) أشهر إبداعاتها. تعود اليوم لمجموعة بريتيش أمريكان توباكو.', `gamme_en` = '[]', `gamme_es` = '[]', `gamme_de` = '[]', `gamme_zh` = '[]', `gamme_ar` = '[]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'Henri Wintermans';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey takes its name from a genuine \"hoyo\" — a natural hollow in the hills of Vuelta Abajo, near San Juan y Martínez — long reputed to produce the softest and most aromatic tobacco in all of Cuba. José Gener, a Spanish manufacturer established in Havana, founded the brand in 1865 specifically to exploit this exceptional terroir.\r\n\r\nThe geographic peculiarity of the original hollow has been documented since the eighteenth century. The topographic depression creates a microclimate of slightly higher heat and humidity than the surrounding region, favoring slower leaf maturation and a remarkable concentration of aromatic oils. Farmers of the era reserved these plots for the wrappers of their finest cigars.\r\n\r\nAfter nationalization in 1960, Hoyo de Monterrey joined the Habanos portfolio and was positioned as the emblematic brand of the Cuban soft profile — an alternative to the power of Partagás or Bolívar for those seeking complexity without intensity. This positioning earned it particular success in the British and Scandinavian markets.\r\n\r\nThe Epicure line, introduced in the 1970s, became the house\'s most iconic series. Creamy, floral, with notes of white wood, hazelnut, and a slightly honeyed finish, the Epicures remain among the most celebrated Cuban cigars. The No.2 is the world reference for gentle Cuban robustos — a status it has maintained for five decades that no competitor has entirely dethroned.\r\n\r\nThe Série Epicure de Luxe, reserved for selected markets since 2005, uses leaves from the finest harvests of the original hoyo, aged two additional years before rolling. Connoisseurs who have had the opportunity to smoke it place it at the apex of the Cuban soft profile.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Epicure No. 2\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"The world\'s best-selling Cuban Robusto (50×124mm). Thirty to forty minutes of creamy, floral complexity that defined the gentle Cuban style for a generation. The first serious Cuban cigar many discover — and the one to which they return indefinitely.\"}, {\"name\": \"Epicure No. 1\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Laguito No.5 format (38×175mm) — slender, almost delicate. Sixty minutes of rare subtlety: white flowers, sandalwood, a Darjeeling tea finish. For enthusiasts seeking the most delicate complexity in the Cuban portfolio.\"}, {\"name\": \"Double Epicure\", \"color\": \"#7B3F00\", \"story\": \"Generoso format (50×155mm) that gives the Epicure formula 60 minutes to reveal notes of aged cedar and white chocolate absent in shorter formats.\"}, {\"name\": \"Série Epicure de Luxe\", \"color\": \"#5C2800\", \"story\": \"Selective edition using leaves from the original hoyo aged two additional years. Very limited production. For those who have exhausted the pleasure of Epicure No.1 and No.2 and seek their ultimate expression.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Winston Churchill\", \"anecdote\": \"Churchill officially preferred Romeo y Julieta — but his personal archives mention Hoyo as his \'secret second love\', particularly in the late afternoon during Parliamentary sessions.\"}, {\"name\": \"British and Scandinavian markets\", \"anecdote\": \"Hoyo de Monterrey is the preferred Cuban brand of British and Scandinavian smokers — markets that historically value soft complexity over direct power. Exports to these countries represent a disproportionate share of total production.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Tea\", \"name\": \"Grand Cru Oolong\", \"notes\": \"The most unexpected and most successful pairing for the Cuban soft range. The light tannins of Oolong amplify the florality of the Epicure without ever overpowering it — a marriage of delicacies.\"}, {\"type\": \"Spirits\", \"name\": \"Calvados Pays d\'Auge XO\", \"notes\": \"Fermented apple plays in harmony with the fruity and honeyed notes of the Epicures. A surprising Norman-Cuban pairing of genuine elegance.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Meursault Premier Cru\", \"notes\": \"Burgundy chardonnay in its creamiest form naturally accompanies the white wood and hazelnut notes. The winning pairing at discreet gastronomic tables.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Hoyo de Monterrey';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The origin story of Joya de Nicaragua contains an irony that the company\'s historians note with evident relish: Nicaragua\'s most celebrated cigar brand was created by the government most American administrations of the era were supporting. Anastasio Somoza, whose regime Washington backed as a bulwark against communist influence in Central America, founded Joya de Nicaragua in 1968 as a state enterprise intended to develop the country\'s tobacco industry for export.\r\n\r\nThe timing was excellent. American cigar culture in the late 1960s was entering a period of expansion and premiumization, and the US trade embargo against Cuba had created demand for alternatives to Havana that the existing production centers — the Dominican Republic, Honduras — could not fully satisfy. Nicaraguan tobacco from the Jalapa and Jalapa Valleys offered a distinct flavor profile: earthier and more peppery than Dominican, with a specific intensity that experienced tasters recognized as a different expression of New World tobacco.\r\n\r\nJoya de Nicaragua supplied the Nixon, Ford, and Carter administrations. Presidential preferences were known and supplied accordingly. The brand briefly occupied a diplomatic role — a respectable Nicaraguan cigar that American officials could accept and smoke without political difficulty.\r\n\r\nThe Sandinista revolution of 1979 ended that chapter. The factory was nationalized, the management dispersed, and the 1980s brought economic crisis, American embargo, and civil war to a country trying simultaneously to grow tobacco and survive. The factory operated intermittently on reduced capacity, maintaining continuity through conditions that would have destroyed most manufacturing operations.\r\n\r\nPrivate investment returned in 1994. The reconstruction was gradual and deliberate — the new management understood that the brand\'s identity had to be reclaimed through product quality rather than historical narrative. The Antaño 1970, a blend designed to replicate the formula of the original 1970 production using 6-year-aged Nicaraguan tobaccos, announced the renaissance with precision. The Dark Corojo that followed became the most extreme expression of Nicaraguan intensity in commercial production — routinely described by reviewers as the most demanding smoke they had experienced.', `history_es` = 'Fundada en 1968 por el propio presidente Somoza, Joya de Nicaragua fue la primera fábrica premium de Nicaragua. Nixon, Carter y Ford la fumaban. La revolución sandinista la nacionalizó en 1979. Tras años de caos, fue privatizada en 1994. El Antaño 1970 es su renacimiento — y el Dark Corojo se describe habitualmente como el cigarro más fuerte del mundo.', `history_de` = '1968 vom Präsidenten Somoza selbst gegründet, war Joya de Nicaragua die erste Premium-Zigarrenfabrik Nicaraguas. Nixon, Carter und Ford rauchten sie. Die sandinistische Revolution verstaatlichte sie 1979. Nach Jahren des Chaos wurde sie 1994 privatisiert. Der Antaño 1970 ist ihre Wiedergeburt — und der Dark Corojo gilt weithin als die stärkste Zigarre der Welt.', `history_zh` = '1968年由索摩萨总统本人创立，尼加拉瓜之珠是尼加拉瓜第一家高端雪茄工厂。尼克松、卡特和福特都抽过它。桑地诺革命于1979年将其国有化。经历多年混乱后，1994年被私有化。Antaño 1970是其重生之作——Dark Corojo常被描述为世界最强雪茄。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست عام 1968 على يد الرئيس سوموزا نفسه، وكانت جويا دي نيكاراغوا أول مصنع سيجار فاخر في نيكاراغوا. دخّنها نيكسون وكارتر وفورد. قامت الثورة الساندينية بتأميمها عام 1979. بعد سنوات من الفوضى، خُصِّصت عام 1994. الأنتانيو 1970 بعثها من جديد.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. Notes of leather, black licorice, sugarless coffee, long pepper. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Notes of dark cocoa, cinnamon, undergrowth, coffee. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notes of hazelnut, milk chocolate, white pepper. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tabaco añejado 6 years minimum. Notas de cuero, black regaliz, sugarless café, long pimienta. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). La most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Notas de dark cocoa, canela, undergrowth, café. Producción anual estrictamente limitada.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Notas de avellana, milk chocolate, white pimienta. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. Noten von Leder, black licorice, sugarless Kaffee, long Pfeffer. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular Cigar Aficionado Score 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. Noten von dark cocoa, cinnamon, undergrowth, Kaffee. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. Noten von Haselnuss, milk Schokolade, white Pfeffer. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. 风味： 皮革, black 甘草, sugarless 咖啡, long 胡椒. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. 风味： dark cocoa, 肉桂, undergrowth, 咖啡. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. 风味： 榛子, milk 巧克力, white 胡椒. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Antaño 1970\", \"color\": \"#1C0A00\", \"story\": \"Recreation of the original presidential 1970 blend. Nicaraguan tobacco aged 6 years minimum. نكهات:  جلد, black عرق السوس, sugarless قهوة, long فلفل. Extreme full body — reserved for seasoned smokers. Regular تقييم Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Oscuro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Gran Consul\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona Gorda\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2020}]}, {\"name\": \"Cuatro Décadas\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"\'Four Decades\' — anniversary edition for the brand\'s 40th year (2008). The house\'s most complex blend: five countries of tobacco, aged 4 years. نكهات:  dark cocoa, قرفة, undergrowth, قهوة. Annual production strictly limited.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Nicaraguan Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Cabinetta\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible medium-full range. Ecuadorian wrapper over Nicaraguan. نكهات:  بندق, milk شوكولاتة, white فلفل. The entry into Joya\'s universe without full-body commitment. Ideal for discovering the house.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly fumaba Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly rauchte Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Richard Nixon\", \"anecdote\": \"Nixon regularly smoked Joya de Nicaragua at the White House before the total Cuban embargo. \'The only cigar I can smoke without betraying America\' — an apocryphal but plausible quote.\"}, {\"name\": \"Bianca Jagger\", \"anecdote\": \"The 1970s icon, ex-wife of Mick Jagger and Nicaraguan native, was often photographed with Nicaraguan cigars during her activist activities.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 12 years\", \"notes\": \"The patriotic pairing — two exceptional Nicaraguan national productions united in a glass and a hand.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Nicaraguan Matagalpa\", \"notes\": \"The mountain Nicaraguan coffee, slightly fruity, tempers the raw power of the Antaño 1970.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Joya de Nicaragua';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'The Philippine tobacco story is one of the oldest and least told in the premium cigar world. The Spanish colonial administration recognized the quality of Cagayan Valley leaf as early as the seventeenth century and established a tobacco monopoly — the Real Compañía de Filipinas — that controlled production, pricing, and export for over a century. By the time this monopoly was dissolved in 1881, Philippine tobacco had supplied the Spanish market for generations and had developed, in the island\'s traditional farming communities, cultivation techniques adapted specifically to Cagayan soil and climate.\r\n\r\nLa Flor de la Isabela was created in 1881, simultaneously with Tabacalera, as a sister brand intended to occupy a different position in the market. Where Tabacalera would develop toward the fuller expressions of Philippine tobacco, La Flor de la Isabela was conceived as the range that showcased the most delicate characteristics of Cagayan and Ilocos leaf — the florality and herbaceous lightness that distinguishes Philippine tobacco from every other major growing region.\r\n\r\nThe name honors Queen Isabella II of Spain — the monarch under whose reign the tobacco monopoly was reorganized and during whose era the Philippines represented the crown\'s most productive colonial tobacco operation. It is a historical acknowledgment embedded in every band.\r\n\r\nThe leaf sourced from Cagayan and Ilocos for La Flor de la Isabela is selected specifically for its floral qualities — the slightly mentholated, herbaceous character that appears in the retrohale and the extended finish of the best Philippine cigars. This is a flavor dimension that appears in no other major tobacco-growing region at comparable concentration. Cuban tobacco is earthy; Nicaraguan is peppery; Honduran is heavy; Dominican is neutral and refined. Philippine tobacco is uniquely floral — an aromatic register that appeals strongly to smokers whose palate preferences run toward green tea, fresh cedar, and light spice rather than dark earth and cocoa. La Flor de la Isabela is the most complete expression of that profile currently available in the international market.', `history_es` = 'Fundada en 1881 simultáneamente con Tabacalera, La Flor de la Isabela fue nombrada en homenaje a la reina Isabel II de España. Marca hermana de Tabacalera, usa los mismos tabacos Cagayan e Ilocos pero con un perfil más floral y ligero. La expresión más delicada del tabaco filipino.', `history_de` = '1881 gleichzeitig mit Tabacalera gegründet, wurde La Flor de la Isabela zu Ehren von Königin Isabella II. von Spanien benannt. Als Schwestermarke von Tabacalera verwendet sie dieselben Cagayan- und Ilocos-Tabake, aber mit einem blumigeren, leichteren Profil. Der zarteste Ausdruck des philippinischen Tabaks.', `history_zh` = '1881年与烟草公司同时创立，以西班牙女王伊莎贝拉二世命名。作为烟草公司的姊妹品牌，使用相同的卡加延和伊罗戈烟草，但轮廓更加花香清淡。菲律宾烟草最细腻的表达。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست عام 1881 في آنٍ واحد مع تاباكاليرا، وسُمِّيت تكريمًا للملكة إيزابيلا الثانية. علامة شقيقة لتاباكاليرا، تستخدم تبغ كاغايان وإيلوكوس ذاته لكن بملف أكثر زهورية وخفةً. أرق تعبير للتبغ الفلبيني.', `gamme_en` = '[]', `gamme_es` = '[]', `gamme_de` = '[]', `gamme_zh` = '[]', `gamme_ar` = '[]', `celebrities_en` = '[]', `celebrities_es` = '[]', `celebrities_de` = '[]', `celebrities_zh` = '[]', `celebrities_ar` = '[]', `pairings_en` = '[]', `pairings_es` = '[]', `pairings_de` = '[]', `pairings_zh` = '[]', `pairings_ar` = '[]' WHERE `name` = 'La Flor de la Isabela';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco established La Flor Dominicana in Santiago, Dominican Republic in 1996 with a remit he has maintained consistently since: do what others won\'t. In an industry that often rewards the incremental — the slight adjustment to an established blend, the familiar format in a new wrapper — Blanco built his reputation on genuine experimentation and the willingness to make production decisions that most manufacturers would reject on practical grounds.\r\n\r\nThe Double Ligero format — a Double Torpedo measuring 75 x 184mm, making it the largest commercially produced cigar in the world — is the clearest expression of this philosophy. The engineering challenge alone is formidable: the format requires a mold of such specific dimensions that La Flor Dominicana commissioned it exclusively. No other factory possesses the equipment to produce it at scale. The smoking experience it creates — three hours minimum, five distinct aromatic phases that range from light cedar in the first third to deep earth and dark chocolate in the final half-hour — has no equivalent in the commercial market.\r\n\r\nBeyond the headline format, Blanco\'s technical contributions to Dominican cigar production are substantial. He introduced extended fermentation protocols for Dominican ligero leaves that the island\'s other manufacturers later adopted. His sourcing of \'Mystery Ligero\' tobaccos — leaves from undisclosed origins, deliberately unnamed, added to several blends to create a specific character that analytical reviewers cannot fully attribute to known growing regions — is either marketing genius or genuine terroir philosophy depending on your perspective.\r\n\r\nThe Santiago factory produces a catalog that ranges from everyday Dominican mild cigars to the extreme expressions of the Double Ligero. Blanco\'s range of production is unusual for a house of his size — most boutique manufacturers find their register and stay in it. La Flor Dominicana moves across the entire aromatic spectrum, demonstrating that the Dominican Republic, properly pushed, can produce tobacco experiences as demanding as anything Nicaragua or Honduras offers.', `history_es` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco es el gran experimentador del cigarro dominicano. Desde 1996, su casa ha sido el laboratorio más activo de la industria. Su obra maestra: el Double Ligero (75x184mm), el cigarro más grande producido en serie en el mundo. Tres horas de fumada, evolución aromática en cinco actos. Solo una fábrica posee el molde.', `history_de` = 'José \'Jochy\' Blanco ist der große Experimentator der dominikanischen Zigarre. Seit 1996 ist sein Haus das aktivste Labor der Branche. Sein Meisterwerk: der Double Ligero (75x184mm), die weltweit größte Serienzigarre. Drei Stunden Rauchdauer, aromatische Entwicklung in fünf Akten. Nur eine Fabrik besitzt die Form.', `history_zh` = '何塞·\'乔奇\'·布兰科是多米尼加雪茄的伟大实验家。自1996年以来，他的工厂是行业最活跃的实验室。他的杰作：双利加罗（75×184mm），全球量产最大的雪茄。三小时吸食时间，五幕式芳香演变。只有一家工厂拥有这个模具。', `history_ar` = 'خوسيه \'خوتشي\' بلانكو هو المجرِّب العظيم للسيجار الدومينيكاني. منذ 1996 كان مصنعه أنشط مختبر في الصناعة. تحفته: الدبل ليغيرو (75×184ملم)، أكبر سيجار تسلسلي في العالم. ثلاث ساعات تدخين، تطور عطري في خمسة فصول.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, spices, coffee, chocolate, interminable peppery finish. Only one manufacturer possesses the mold. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Notes of gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian coffee. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Notes of hazelnut, cedar, light vanilla. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for enthusiasts hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, especias, café, chocolate, interminable pimientay finish. Solo un fabricante posee el molde. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Notas de gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian café. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Puntuación regular 95+. The Air Bender is considerado la best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Notas de avellana, cedro, light vainilla. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for aficionados hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, Gewürze, Kaffee, Schokolade, interminable Pfeffery finish. Nur ein Hersteller besitzt die Form. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Chisel\", \"Missile\", \"Torpedo\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2018}]}, {\"name\": \"Air Bender\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched 2015, Connecticut Broadleaf maduro wrapper over Dominican. Noten von gingerbread, cardamom, Indonesian Kaffee. Robusto format (52 x 127mm). Regular score 95+. The Air Bender is considered the house\'s best value-for-money.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Broadleaf Maduro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Chisel\", \"Lancero\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 95, \"year\": 2015}]}, {\"name\": \"Colorado Claro\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"Middle range — Colorado wrapper over aged Dominican. Noten von Haselnuss, Zeder, light Vanille. Medium-full, balanced. The LFD entry point for enthusiasts hesitant before the Double Ligero\'s power.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Ligero\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Chisel format (75 x 184mm) — the world\'s largest production cigar. Minimum three hours of smoke. Notes that evolve through five distinct phases: fresh herbs, 香料, 咖啡, 巧克力, interminable 胡椒y finish. 只有一家制造商拥有此模具. Each box is numbered.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Dominican Colorado\", \"vit