on the crop. A unique concept in the cigar world — Plasencia publishes tasting notes for each vintage like a Bordeaux château.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"Alma del Campo\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"\'The Soul of the Field\' — tribute to plantation workers. Corona format (44 x 140mm). Medium, accessible, with the Plasencia earthy signature. نكهات:  dried hay, aromatic herbs, light wood. The everyday cigar for المتحمسون who know the house\'s secrets.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Honduran\", \"vitolas\": [\"Travesía\", \"Candela\", \"Toro\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He is the only person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he reportedly said.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He es el único person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he supuestamente said.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He is the only person in the world who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he angeblich said.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He 是唯一 person 在世界上 who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he 据报道 said.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Nestor Plasencia Sr.\", \"anecdote\": \"Fifth generation, Nestor is simultaneously planter, fermenter, and blender. He هو الوحيد person في العالم who controls the entire tobacco chain — from seed to box — without depending on an outside supplier. \'I am the tobacco,\' he يُقال إن said.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Notes of caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Ron\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Dos iconos nicaragüenses of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Café\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Notas de caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Rum\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"Kaffee\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. Noten von caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"朗姆酒\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"两个尼加拉瓜的标志 of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"咖啡\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. 风味： caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"الروم\", \"name\": \"Flor de Caña 25 years\", \"notes\": \"Two Nicaraguan icons of patience — 25 years of aging for one, five generations of expertise for the other.\"}, {\"type\": \"القهوة\", \"name\": \"Honduran Marcala\", \"notes\": \"Coffee from the same lands as the Cosecha blend. نكهات: caramel and citrus that harmonize with the gentle earthiness of an Alma del Campo.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Plasencia';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Punch was born in 1840, the same year that the British satirical magazine bearing the same name published its first issue. The coincidence was not accidental. Manuel López, the Spanish manufacturer who created the brand in Havana, was targeting the British market with precision. He understood that English buyers — who already dominated Cuban cigar imports through houses like Hunters & Frankau — responded to wit, to cultural reference, to the sense that a luxury product understood their world. Naming a cigar after London\'s sharpest satirical journal was a statement of cultural alignment. It worked immediately.\r\n\r\nThe Mr. Punch character — the hook-nosed, pointy-hatted jester of the Punch and Judy tradition — appeared on the brand\'s bands from the first year and has remained there for 180 years. He is tobacco\'s longest-serving mascot, predating every corporate logo in the modern industry. Victorian London\'s gentlemen\'s clubs — White\'s, Brooks\'s, the Reform, the Garrick — maintained dedicated Punch cellars. The brand supplied royal households. The expression of satisfaction at the delivery of a long-awaited order became, briefly, one of the meanings of the phrase \'pleased as Punch.\'\r\n\r\nDuring the mid-nineteenth century, Punch was the best-selling cigar brand in the British market — a position it maintained until the First World War disrupted trade and changed smoking habits permanently. The brand survived both world wars, nationalization in 1959, and the American trade embargo that removed it from the United States market entirely. Through all of this, the factory — shared with H. Upmann at the Havana address that both brands still occupy — maintained the quality standards that had built the original reputation.\r\n\r\nThe Punch aromatic profile occupies the middle ground of the Cuban spectrum with considerable authority. Woody and peppery on entry, with notes of roasted cashew and white cedar in the middle, resolving in the final third into a long finish of dried fruit and faint honey. It is not the most powerful Cuban and not the most delicate. It is, instead, the most dependably pleasurable — the cigar that experienced smokers reach for when they want conversation and company rather than a solo meditation.\r\n\r\nThe Punch Double Corona, at 49 x 194mm, is one of the format\'s finest expressions in the Cuban portfolio — 90 minutes that demonstrate what mature Vuelta Abajo tobacco can do with sufficient time and ring gauge. The Punch Punch, the house\'s signature Robusto, delivers the full profile in 45 minutes with a consistency that has made it one of the most reviewed and re-reviewed cigars in Havana\'s catalog. Cigar Aficionado has rated it between 91 and 94 across six separate assessments — a record of reliability that speaks directly to what the brand has always offered: not surprise, but confidence.', `history_es` = 'Punch nació en 1840 bajo Manuel López, tomando su nombre de la famosa revista británica del mismo año. Fue el cigarro más vendido en Gran Bretaña durante la era victoriana. Sus notas maderosas y pimienta a precio moderado lo convierten en la puerta de entrada para muchos aficionados.', `history_de` = 'Punch wurde 1840 von Manuel López gegründet und nach der gleichnamigen britischen Satirezeitschrift benannt. Im viktorianischen Zeitalter war es die meistverkaufte Zigarre in Großbritannien. Seine holzigen, pfeffrigen Noten zu moderatem Preis machen es für viele zum Einstieg.', `history_zh` = 'Punch于1840年由曼努埃尔·洛佩斯创立，以同年创刊的英国讽刺杂志命名。维多利亚时代是英国最畅销的雪茄。木质与胡椒风味、价格适中，是许多爱好者的入门之选。', `history_ar` = 'أُسِّست Punch عام 1840 على يد مانويل لوبيث، واتُّخذ اسمها من المجلة البريطانية الساخرة الصادرة في العام ذاته. كانت الأكثر مبيعًا في بريطانيا خلال العهد الفيكتوري. نكهاتها الخشبية والفلفلية بسعر معقول تجعلها بوابة الدخول لكثير من المتذوقين.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 minutes of woody, peppery smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Notes of oak, white pepper, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Notes of cedar wood, pepper, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For enthusiasts who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 minutos of woody, pimientay smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Notas de oak, white pimienta, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Notas de cedro wood, pimienta, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For aficionados who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 Minuten of woody, Pfeffery smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. Noten von oak, white Pfeffer, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. Noten von Zeder wood, Pfeffer, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For enthusiasts who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90分钟 of woody, 胡椒y smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. 风味： oak, white 胡椒, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. 风味： 雪松木 wood, 胡椒, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For 爱好者 who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Double Corona\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Double Corona format (49 x 194mm). The house centerpiece — 90 دقيقة of woody, فلفلy smoke. The Punch Double Corona is a reference for this giant format in Cuba, less known than Partagás\'s Lusitanias but equal in quality. نكهات:  oak, white فلفل, undergrowth.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Double Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 92, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Punch\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Mareva format (42 x 129mm). The eponymous cigar — woody, straightforward, without intellectual pretension. The Punch Punch (its actual name, doubled per Cuban tradition) is the cigar of London pubs and Parisian terraces. نكهات:  أرز wood, فلفل, dried herbs.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Punch\"]}, {\"name\": \"Serie D No.4\", \"color\": \"#5C4033\", \"story\": \"Robusto (50 x 124mm). Full-body Punch style. More accessible than Partagás\'s Serie D but in the same spirit — direct, woody, satisfying. For المتحمسون who want the power without the Partagás price.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Serie D No.4\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. He reportedly said: \'The cigar is the only luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he fumaba them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. Supuestamente dijo: \'The cigar es el único luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he rauchte them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. Er soll gesagt haben: \'The cigar is the only luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. 据报道他曾说： \'The cigar 是唯一 luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Prince of Wales (future Edward VII)\", \"anecdote\": \"The future King of England, a great Cuban cigar enthusiast, helped popularize Punch in British aristocratic circles. His mother Queen Victoria banned cigars at court — he smoked them in secret, which added to the charm.\"}, {\"name\": \"Evelyn Waugh\", \"anecdote\": \"The author of Brideshead Revisited was a notorious Punch smoker. يُروى أنه قال: \'The cigar هو الوحيد luxury accessible to the man without fortune but with taste.\'\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Beer\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"The natural pairing — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Cerveza\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"El maridaje natural — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bier\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"Die natürliche Paarung — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"Whisky\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"啤酒\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"天然的搭配 — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"威士忌\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البيرة\", \"name\": \"British Real Ale\", \"notes\": \"المقارنة الطبيعية — high-fermentation beer, slightly bitter and biscuity, accompanies the woody profile of a Punch perfectly. A pub pairing.\"}, {\"type\": \"الويسكي\", \"name\": \"Laphroaig 10 years\", \"notes\": \"The intense peat of Laphroaig creates with the Punch Double Corona a powerful smoky-woody pairing. For lovers of intensity.\"}, {\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Rioja Reserva\", \"notes\": \"The wood and spices of Rioja Reserva amplify the peppery profile of a Punch. A classic Ibero-Cuban pairing.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Punch';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Quintero is the best-kept secret of the Habanos portfolio. Founded in 1924 in Cienfuegos by Agustín Quintero Benítez, the manufacture produced for decades cigars destined almost exclusively for the Spanish market — a country that developed with Quintero a relationship of fidelity comparable to the British relationship with Romeo y Julieta.\r\n\r\nQuintero\'s originality lies in its regional provenance. Unlike the great Havana brands that source exclusively from western Vuelta Abajo, Quintero historically used tobaccos from Vuelta Arriba — the eastern provinces of Cuba — lighter, more herbaceous, with an aromatic signature distinctly different from the western terroir. This particularity created a unique profile: unmistakably Cuban, but with a lightness and herbaceousness that Partagás fans found disconcerting, and that Quintero enthusiasts found irreplaceable.\r\n\r\nAfter nationalization, Quintero joined Habanos S.A. but retained its priority distribution to Spain. The brand remains virtually unknown outside the Iberian Peninsula and the circles of very well-informed connoisseurs — a situation that perfectly suits the aficionados who discover it and realize they have access to exceptional Cuban cigars at prices absurdly low relative to their actual quality.\r\n\r\nThe Medias Coronas (40×102mm) is the house\'s most iconic vitola: quick, economical, with a light herbaceous and slightly mentholated freshness that Spanish espresso drinkers have adopted as a daily ritual for more than sixty years. It is probably the most smoked Cuban cigar in Spain, and the least known outside it.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Medias Coronas\", \"color\": \"#8B6914\", \"story\": \"40×102mm — the legendary short format that defines the brand in Spain. Twenty-five minutes of fresh herbaceousness, light honey, and cedar. The morning cigar of Spanish aficionados since 1924. Accessible price, remarkable quality.\"}, {\"name\": \"Brevas\", \"color\": \"#7A5C0F\", \"story\": \"Standard format (40×140mm) — the accessible core range. Notes of fresh grass, dried tobacco, light honey finish. The perfect daily cigar for those who appreciate Cuban lightness.\"}, {\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#6B4E10\", \"story\": \"Long format (47×178mm) that reveals the full complexity of Vuelta Arriba terroir. Herbaceous on entry, evolving toward oak wood and dried tobacco, with a distinctly Cuban green tea finish.\"}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Spanish aficionados\", \"anecdote\": \"Quintero has no celebrity attached to its history — which is precisely what makes it the beloved brand of genuine Spanish connoisseurs. For decades, Madrid and Barcelona tobacco shops sold Quintero to clients who wanted something less exhibitionist and equally good as the major brands.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Coffee\", \"name\": \"Spanish café con leche\", \"notes\": \"The original and definitive pairing. The Medias Coronas smoked while preparing the morning coffee is a century-old Spanish ritual. The milky sweetness perfectly balances the cigar\'s herbaceousness.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Manzanilla de Sanlúcar\", \"notes\": \"The lightest and most marine sherry plays with the herbaceous freshness of the Quintero in an Andalusian pairing of great coherence. Deceptive lightness on both sides.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Quintero';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Rocky Patel\'s professional trajectory is the cigar industry\'s most improbable success story in the American market. He spent his twenties as a Los Angeles entertainment attorney, representing clients in the industry whose hours made cigar lounges a natural professional habitat. He learned about tobacco the way lawyers learn about most things: by asking questions, reading extensively, and talking to people who actually knew. By the early 1990s, he understood the premium cigar market better than most of his peers in the legal profession.\r\n\r\nIn 1995, he decided to enter it. He had no tobacco-growing background, no manufacturing relationships, and no trade network. He had legal skills, commercial instincts, and a specific thesis: that the American cigar boom of the 1990s was creating demand that existing premium manufacturers were not meeting at accessible price points. Padrón was excellent but expensive. Davidoff was flawless but positioned for a different customer. There was a gap between genuine quality and daily affordability that no one was addressing with the same seriousness he intended to apply.\r\n\r\nThe Vintage series — which he introduced in the early 2000s — articulated this thesis in product form. Cigars built around tobaccos aged from the vintage year indicated on the band, sold at prices that allowed serious daily smoking rather than occasional ceremony. The 1990, 1992, and 1999 Vintages earned critical scores between 92 and 95 consistently across multiple reviews, establishing the brand\'s credibility with the segment that had previously dismissed accessible price-point cigars as a compromise.\r\n\r\nThe catalog that followed — now extending to over 30 ranges in multiple price tiers — represents the most comprehensive approach to market segmentation in the premium American industry. Each range addresses a specific taste preference and budget, with the manufacturing quality maintaining a floor that prevents any Rocky Patel cigar from embarrassing the brand regardless of its price point. This consistency is the direct result of Patel\'s long-term relationships with Honduran manufacturers, developed over two decades of increasingly specific collaborative production.', `history_es` = 'Rocky Patel abandonó su carrera de abogado en Los Ángeles en 1995 para fundar su propia marca. Vendía cajas desde el maletero de su coche. Su gran ruptura llegó con la serie Vintage — cigarros construidos alrededor de tabacos envejecidos desde los años correspondientes. Generosidad sin comprometer la calidad, precio accesible para fumadores diarios.', `history_de` = 'Rocky Patel gab 1995 seine Anwaltskarriere in Los Angeles auf, um seine eigene Marke zu gründen. Er verkaufte Kisten aus seinem Kofferraum. Sein Durchbruch kam mit der Vintage-Serie — Zigarren rund um Tabake gebaut, die seit den entsprechenden Jahrgängen gelagert wurden. Großzügigkeit ohne Qualitätskompromisse, zu einem Preis für tägliche Raucher.', `history_zh` = '洛基·帕特尔于1995年放弃洛杉矶律师生涯创立自己的品牌。他从汽车后备箱卖雪茄。他的重大突破是老年份系列——围绕相应年份陈化烟草打造的雪茄。品质不打折扣的慷慨，日常吸烟者可负担的价格。', `history_ar` = 'روكي باتيل ترك مهنة المحاماة في لوس أنجلوس عام 1995 لتأسيس علامته. كان يبيع العلب من صندوق سيارته. اختراقه الكبير جاء مع سلسلة فينتاج — سيجار مبني حول تبغ معتَّق من السنوات المقابلة. كرم دون تنازل عن الجودة، بسعر في متناول المدخنين اليوميين.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Notes of toasted hazelnut, caramel, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Notes of coffee, oriental spices, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet notes of cream and hazelnut. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tabaco añejado since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Notas de tostado avellana, caramelo, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Notas de café, oriental especias, undergrowth. One of la finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet notas de cream and avellana. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. Noten von geröstet Haselnuss, Karamell, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. Noten von Kaffee, oriental Gewürze, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet Noten von cream and Haselnuss. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. 风味： 烘烤 榛子, 焦糖, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. 风味： 咖啡, oriental 香料, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet 风味包括： cream and 榛子. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `gamme_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Vintage 1992\", \"color\": \"#8B4513\", \"story\": \"Honduran and Nicaraguan tobacco aged since 1992. Ecuador Connecticut wrapper. نكهات:  محمَّص بندق, كراميل, light wood. Medium-Full, well-balanced. The Vintage series is the market\'s most original narrative proposition — each vintage tells a specific plantation year\'s story.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuador Connecticut\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Churchill\", \"Robusto\", \"Corona\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 91, \"year\": 2019}]}, {\"name\": \"Fifty Years\", \"color\": \"#722F37\", \"story\": \"Launched for Rocky Patel\'s 50th birthday. Complex Honduran-Nicaraguan blend, Ecuadorian Sun-Grown wrapper. نكهات:  قهوة, oriental توابل, undergrowth. One of the house\'s finest cigars, often underrated against the Vintage series.\", \"force\": \"Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Ecuadorian Sun-Grown\", \"vitolas\": [\"Toro\", \"Robusto\", \"Churchill\", \"Torpedo\"]}, {\"name\": \"The Edge\", \"color\": \"#A0522D\", \"story\": \"The accessible house range. Connecticut wrapper over Honduran/Nicaraguan. Sweet نكهات:  cream and بندق. The first Rocky Patel for a newcomer — easy to approach, consistent, rewarding. Democratic pricing.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Connecticut Shade\", \"vitolas\": [\"Robusto\", \"Toro\", \"Torpedo\", \"Corona\", \"Gordo\"]}]', `celebrities_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `celebrities_ar` = '[{\"name\": \"Rocky Patel\", \"anecdote\": \"When Patel announced to his lawyer clients he was leaving law for cigars, several offered him money to help open. \'That\'s the opposite of what usually happens when you leave the law,\' he said.\"}]', `pairings_en` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wine\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_es` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Vino\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_de` = '[{\"type\": \"Bourbon\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"Wein\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_zh` = '[{\"type\": \"波旁威士忌\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"葡萄酒\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]', `pairings_ar` = '[{\"type\": \"البوربون\", \"name\": \"Maker\'s Mark\", \"notes\": \"The soft, vanilla Maker\'s Mark bourbon pairs perfectly with the Vintage series — two products that value aging without intimidation.\"}, {\"type\": \"النبيذ\", \"name\": \"Argentine Malbec\", \"notes\": \"The fruity, spiced structure of Malbec complements the Fifty Years profile nicely. A pairing of the Americas.\"}]' WHERE `name` = 'Rocky Patel';
UPDATE `brands` SET `history_en` = 'Romeo y Julieta was founded in 1875 by Inocencio Álvarez, a Havana manufacturer who understood that a great name was the first condition of greatness. The brand\'s romantic title — drawn from Shakespeare, whose plays Cuban cigar workers knew well through their lector sessions — carried an emotional charge that translated across languages and cultures. Within two decades, Romeo y Julieta had won gold medals at exhibitions in Amsterdam, Paris, and Chicago. Álvarez commissioned the finest lithographers in Havana to produce bands and box labels of extraordinary visual quality. The brand looked like what it tasted like: exceptional.\r\n\r\nThe defining relationship in the brand\'s history began in 1895. Winston Churchill was 21 years old, working as a war correspondent covering the Cuban independence struggle, and he was introduced to Romeo y Julieta cigars during his three-week stay in Havana. The encounter was transformative. Churchill would go on to smoke between 8 and 10 cigars per day, every single day, for the next 70 years — through two world wars, the Blitz, countless parliamentary sessions, and the writing of a six-volume history of the Second World War that earned him the Nobel Prize in Literature. His absolute preference was the Double Corona: 47 x 178mm, approximately 45 minutes of floral, creamy, cedary complexity that companions describe as inseparable from the man himself.\r\n\r\nThe brand honored the relationship in 1948 by naming its Double Corona format the Churchill — a distinction no other brand had offered a living statesman. Churchill reportedly found the gesture amusing rather than presumptuous. The format remains the centerpiece of the collection, made at the Romeo y Julieta factory in Havana\'s Belascoaín district and distributed through Habanos S.A.\'s global network.\r\n\r\nRomeo y Julieta\'s profile stands in deliberate contrast to the power brands of the Cuban portfolio. Where Partagás and Bolívar push earthiness and intensity, Romeo trades in florality, cream, and an almost orchestral sense of progression. The cigars open with cedar and light spice, develop through hazelnut and white pepper, and finish on dried fruit and honey. It is the brand that most converts describe as their gateway to understanding what Cuban tobacco could be — and for many serious smokers, it is the brand they return to after exploring the extremes.\r\n\r\nThe Reserva line, using aged tobaccos from selected Vuelta Abajo plots, extends the house\'s ambition into collector territory. The Wide Churchill, launched in 2008, updated the classic format with a slightly wider ring gauge that delivers a cooler, longer smoke. The brand\'s limited editions — released annually through Habanos S.A.\'s Gran Reserva and Regional Edition programs — are among the most anticipated in the calendar.', `history_es` = 'Romeo y Julieta fue fundada en 1875 por Inocencio Álvarez. Debe su fama mundial a Sir Winston Churchill, quien la descubrió en Cuba a los 21 años y fumó entre 8 y 10 cigarros diarios hasta su muerte. El Churchill (47x178mm), formato bautizado en su honor, es 45 minutos de complejidad floral y cremosa.', `history_de` = 'Romeo y Julieta wurde 1875 von Inocencio Álvarez gegründet. Weltberühmt wurde die Marke durch Sir Winston Churchill, der sie mit 21 Jahren in Kuba entdeckte und bis zu seinem Tod täglich 8 bis 10 Zigarren rauchte. Das Churchill-Format (47x178mm) wurde ihm zu Ehren benannt.', `history_zh` = '罗密欧与朱丽叶由伊诺西昂西奥·阿尔瓦雷斯于1875年创立。它的世界声誉归功于温斯顿·丘吉尔——他21岁在古巴发现了这个品牌，此后每天吸8至10支，直到去世。以他命名的丘吉尔规格（47×178mm）是45分钟的花香与奶油复杂性。', `history_ar` = 'تأسست روميو وخولييتا عام 1875 على يد إينوسينسيو ألفاريز. اشتهرت عالميًا بفضل السير ونستون تشرشل الذي اكتشفها في كوبا وهو في الحادية والعشرين، وظل يدخن 8 إلى 10 سيجارات يوميًا حتى وفاته. مقاس تشرشل (47×178ملم) سُمِّي على شرفه.', `gamme_en` = '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedar notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing enthusiasts. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Cigar Aficionado score 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vanilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutes. Reserved for enthusiasts who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some collectors travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', `gamme_es` = '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft cedro notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing aficionados. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Puntuación Cigar Aficionado 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and vainilla notes. Smoked in 60 minutos. Reserved for aficionados who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some coleccionistas travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', `gamme_de` = '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 minutes of smoke. Floral, cream, soft Zeder notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing enthusiasts. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. Cigar Aficionado Score 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\": \"#B22222\", \"story\": \"Launched in 1875, Petit Corona format (42 x 127mm). The perfect introduction to the Romeo y Julieta universe — sweet, floral, slightly creamy. Experts recommend starting here before venturing toward the Churchill.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Exhibición No.4\", \"Exhibición No.3\"]}, {\"name\": \"Wide Churchill\", \"color\": \"#8B0000\", \"story\": \"Thick format (55 x 178mm), same length as the Churchill but ring gauge 55 — one of the widest ever produced in Cuba. The increased wrapper surface intensifies the creamy and Vanille notes. Smoked in 60 Minuten. Reserved for enthusiasts who do not compromise on ring gauge.\", \"force\": \"Medium-Full\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Colorado\", \"vitolas\": [\"Wide Churchill\"]}, {\"name\": \"Regional Editions\", \"color\": \"#9B2335\", \"story\": \"Romeo y Julieta produces annual regional editions exclusively for different markets — Germany, Spain, UK, Benelux. The Cazadores EL (2018, Germany) and Short Churchills EL are particularly sought after. Some collectors travel across Europe solely to acquire local regional editions.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Variable\", \"vitolas\": [\"Cazadores\", \"Short Churchill\", \"Coloniales\"]}]', `gamme_zh` = '[{\"name\": \"Churchill\", \"color\": \"#DC143C\", \"story\": \"Churchill format (47 x 178mm) — named directly after the Prime Minister. 45 分钟 of smoke. Floral, cream, soft 雪松木 notes. The most accessible and recommended cigar for developing 爱好者. Churchill himself ordered personalized boxes with his distinctive band. 雪茄爱好者杂志评分 93.\", \"force\": \"Medium\", \"wrapper\": \"Habano Claro\", \"vitolas\": [\"Churchill\"], \"scores\": [{\"source\": \"Cigar Aficionado\", \"score\": 93, \"year\": 2021}]}, {\"name\": \"Exhibición No.4\", \"color\